nt (size 2 2) bold) (justify left)) (uuid 05dee749-a465-4697-b921-f36b5005d817)) (text "ASTRADAND: hold the trigger, draw a shape in the air, release. The 6-axis IMU is read over I2C at 50 Hz; the" (at 20 356.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 393d01d7-4847-4ddc-bd6d-250449f44053)) (text "ATmega matches the drawn path against six spell templates. Piezo is driven differentially from OC1A/OC1B" (at 20 360.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 3a317c37-4eb5-4471-bd0b-cc88fb0c6446)) (text "(D9/D10). LEDs are fed from +4V5 through a high-side switch (Q3, driven by Q4 from D5) and a Schottky (D20)," (at 20 363.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 68bd640d-fc5f-4507-ac69-4b45eed7e401)) (text "so the pixels draw nothing in sleep so that their 0.7 x VDD data threshold stays below the 3.3 V logic level;" (at 20 366.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid b8eb5831-0b28-4e96-ab80-97918f1ca5b4)) (text "the firmware caps the pixel current." (at 20 370.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid f327aa81-2033-4564-b30a-fd5fd12ab2ed)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))